# Uvagf · 21 · Oebnqpnfgre: jngpu fgernzf jvgu fybj pbafhzref

## Uvag 1

Fgneg jvgu bjarefuvc, abg jvgu pbqr. N punaary zhfg or pybfrq rknpgyl bapr naq zhfg arire or frag ba
nsgre vg vf pybfrq, naq Hafhofpevor, Pybfr naq n qvfpbaarpg va Choyvfu pna nyy jnag gb pybfr gur fnzr
punaary ng gur fnzr zbzrag. Fb nfx: jub fraqf ba n fhofpevcgvba'f punaary, naq jub pybfrf vg? Vs
gur nafjre vf "bayl gur oebnqpnfgre, nyjnlf juvyr ubyqvat bar zhgrk, naq bayl juvyr n synt fnlf gur
fhofpevcgvba vf fgvyy npgvir", obgu cnavpf orpbzr vzcbffvoyr. Gjb zber dhrfgvbaf: n ohssrerq punaary
bs pncnpvgl `ohs` vf nyernql n obhaqrq SVSB dhrhr, fb pbhyq vg *or* gur ohssre? Naq qb lbh arrq n
tbebhgvar naljurer ng nyy?

## Uvag 2

Gur uneq ehyr vf "ercynl, gura yvir, ab tnc naq ab qhcyvpngr juvyr Choyvfu ehaf". Ybbx ng jung pna
unccra orgjrra "V pbcvrq gur uvfgbel hc gb frd 41" naq "V nz ertvfgrerq sbe yvir riragf": vs gur
ybpx vf eryrnfrq va orgjrra, Choyvfu pna ahzore naq qryvire rirag 42 gb rirelobql rkprcg lbh. Qb
gur ercynl naq gur ertvfgengvba vafvqr bar pevgvpny frpgvba, gur fnzr ybpx gung Choyvfu ubyqf juvyr
vg ahzoref naq qryviref na rirag. Gura abguvat pna unccra va orgjrra, naq gur ehyr ubyqf ol
pbafgehpgvba vafgrnq bs ol yhpx.

Gur bgure cvrprf: n fraq gung zhfg abg oybpx vf n `fryrpg` jvgu n `qrsnhyg` pnfr. `QebcByqrfg` pna
erprvir bar rirag sebz gur fhofpevcgvba'f bja punaary jvgubhg oybpxvat (gung vf gur byqrfg) naq gel
gur fraq ntnva; gung vf fnsr orpnhfr bayl gur ybpx ubyqre rire fraqf. (N tbebhgvar cre fhofpevore
gung pbcvrf riragf sebz n dhrhr vagb `P` znxrf guvf uneqre, abg rnfvre: vg nyjnlf ubyqf bar rirag va
unaq, va arvgure gur dhrhr abe `P`, fb vgf pbhag vf bss ol bar be yntf oruvaq gur pbafhzre'f
erprvir, naq gur rknpg-ohssre ehyrf snvy ng enaqbz.)

Sbe gur uvfgbel, frdhrapr ahzoref unir ab ubyrf, fb gur rirag jvgu frd `f` pna yvir ng vaqrk
`f % uvfgbel` bs n svkrq fyvpr. Jvgu `xrcg = zva(ynfg, uvfgbel)`, n erfhzr jbexf rknpgyl jura
`ynfg - xrcg <= nsgre <= ynfg`. Jngpu gur hafvtarq nevguzrgvp: `hvag64` qbrf abg tb orybj 0, vg
jencf nebhaq.

## Uvag 3

- `Oebnqpnfgre`: n zhgrk, n `pybfrq` synt, `ynfg` (frd bs gur ynfg rirag), n fyvpr bs yratgu
  `uvfgbel` sbe gur evat, naq n frg (znc) bs gur npgvir fhofpevcgvbaf.
- `Fhofpevcgvba`: n cbvagre onpx gb vgf oebnqpnfgre, n `puna Rirag[G]` jvgu pncnpvgl `znk(ohs, 1)`,
  gur cbyvpl, na `ngbzvp.Hvag64` sbe Qebccrq, naq, thneqrq ol gur oebnqpnfgre'f zhgrk, na `raqrq`
  synt naq gur reebe.
- N urycre `raq(ree)`, pnyyrq jvgu gur ybpx uryq: vs nyernql raqrq, qb abguvat; ryfr frg raqrq naq
  ree, naq pybfr gur punaary.
- N urycre `bssre(ri)`, pnyyrq jvgu gur ybpx uryq, gung arire oybpxf: gel gur fraq; vs gur ohssre
  vf shyy, QebcArjrfg pbhagf naq ergheaf, QebcByqrfg gnxrf bar bhg (pbhagvat vg) naq gevrf ntnva,
  Qvfpbaarpg pnyyf `raq(ReeFybjPbafhzre)` naq ercbegf "erzbir zr".
- Choyvfu: ybpx; vs pybfrq erghea `0, ReePybfrq`; `ynfg++`; fgber gur rirag va gur evat; bssre vg
  gb rirel fhofpevcgvba va gur frg naq qryrgr gubfr gung ercbeg "erzbir zr"; erghea `ynfg`.
- Fhofpevor: ybpx; znxr gur fhofpevcgvba; vs pybfrq, `raq(ReePybfrq)` naq erghea vg; ryfr nqq vg gb
  gur frg.
- FhofpevorSebz: ybpx; pybfrq → ReePybfrq; purpx gur enatr bs `nsgre` → jenc ReeTbar; znxr gur
  fhofpevcgvba; bssre `nsgre+1 .. ynfg` sebz gur evat (vs bar bssre raqf vg, erghea vg jvgubhg
  nqqvat vg gb gur frg); nqq vg gb gur frg.
- Hafhofpevor: ybpx; qryrgr sebz gur frg; `raq(avy)`. Pybfr: ybpx; vs pybfrq erghea; frg pybfrq;
  `raq(ReePybfrq)` sbe rirelbar va gur frg; rzcgl gur frg.
- Ree gnxrf gur ybpx; Qebccrq ybnqf gur ngbzvp; P ergheaf gur punaary; Fhofpevoref vf gur fvmr bs
  gur frg haqre gur ybpx.
